# A pane opened with Ctrl+W s from a Today pane hiding completed hides them too, and has no history to go back to.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
END
keys gt gc
hide Write report
keys <C-w> s
see │  󰖙 Today
keys H
see │  󰖙 Today
hide Write report
keys gc
see Write report
quit
